    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your speed increases by 10 feet while you aren't wearing armor or wielding a Shield. This bonus increases when you reach certain Monk levels, as shown on the Monk Features table.</p><p><strong>Current Increase:</strong> [[lookup @scale.monk.unarmored-movement]]</p><section id=\"secret-2fH97uVacHRVqDCo\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes an Unarmored Movement Active Effect which adds 10 feet to your Movement. It can not automatically update as you level up though. You can edit the value to match your current increase.</p></section>",
